      "[회사명] BEARING CO.": "[Company Name] BEARING CO.",
      "\n          사업자등록번호 000-00-00000 · 대표 홍길동<br>\n          비공개 (문의 시 안내드립니다)\n        ": "\n          Business Registration No. 000-00-00000 · CEO Hong Gil-dong<br>\n          Not disclosed (available upon inquiry)\n        ",
      "\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">취급제품</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">문의</a>\n      ": "\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">Company</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">Products</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">Contact</a>\n      ",
      "\n        ※ 위 UC·UK 인서트용 하우징 표는 SWS 카탈로그에 없어 JIB(제일베어링) 공식 카탈로그(하우징 치수표, B01/B07/B08/B09/B10/B11/B17/B19/B25/B26/B27/B28/B32/B34/B40/B42/B46/B47/B48/B49 섹션)를 기준으로 작성했습니다. 하우징은 여러 축경을 하나의 규격으로 겸용하는 경우가 많아, 겸용되는 축경 범위를 “적용 축경”으로 표시했습니다. H·L 외의 세부 치수(J·F·볼트 규격 등)는 정식 도면으로 별도 안내드리며, 구면 롤러 베어링용 SN 하우징은 <a href=\"plummer_block.html\">플러머 블럭</a> 페이지를 참고해 주세요. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 견적 문의로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.\n      ": "\n        * The above housing tables for UC/UK insert bearings are not found in the SWS catalog, so they were compiled based on the official JIB (Jeil Bearing) catalog (housing dimension tables, sections B01/B07/B08/B09/B10/B11/B17/B19/B25/B26/B27/B28/B32/B34/B40/B42/B46/B47/B48/B49). Since a single housing specification often covers multiple shaft diameters, the range of shaft diameters it covers is shown as \"Applicable Shaft Dia.\" Detailed dimensions other than H/L (such as J, F, bolt specifications, etc.) are provided separately via official drawings; for SN housings used with spherical roller bearings, please refer to the <a href=\"plummer_block.html\">Plummer Block</a> page. Before precision machining or ordering, please always make a final confirmation via a quote inquiry.\n      ",
      "형번": "Model Number",
      "적용 축경(mm)": "Applicable Shaft Dia. (mm)",
      "H(중심높이)": "H (Center Height)",
      "L(전장)": "L (Overall Length)",
      "중량(kg)": "Weight (kg)",
      "\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Unit Case (Housing) · SALP·SBLP Type</p>\n        <h2>유닛 케이스 — SALP·SBLP (경량 필로우)</h2>\n        <p>경량·소형 필로우 하우징(L타입)으로, SA(편심고정링)·SB(세트스크류) 인서트 베어링과 조합합니다. P형보다 작고 가벼워 소형 기계에 적합합니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ": "\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Unit Case (Housing) · SALP·SBLP Type</p>\n        <h2>Unit Housing — SALP·SBLP (Lightweight Pillow)</h2>\n        <p>A lightweight, compact pillow housing (L type), combined with SA (eccentric locking collar) / SB (set screw) insert bearings. Smaller and lighter than the P type, suitable for small machinery.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>\n      ",
      "\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">JIB 카탈로그 규격 도면</p>\n          <img src=\"img/salp_diagram.webp\" alt=\"SALP·SBLP형 유닛 구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ SALP·SBLP 경량 필로우 하우징 단면도 · H(중심높이)·L(전장)</p>\n        ": "\n          <p class=\"diagram-caption\">JIB Catalog Standard Drawing</p>\n          <img src=\"img/salp_diagram.webp\" alt=\"SALP·SBLP type unit structural cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n          <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ SALP·SBLP Lightweight Pillow Housing Cross-Section Diagram · H (Center Height) · L (Overall Length)</p>\n        ",
      "\n          <label for=\"salpFilter\">형번 / 축경 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"salpFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: SALP206 또는 30\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ": "\n          <label for=\"salpFilter\">Search by Model / Shaft Dia.</label>\n          <input id=\"salpFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. SALP206 or 30\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ",
      "단위: mm · 중량 범위는 SA(편심고정링)형/SB(세트스크류)형의 차이입니다. JIB 공식 카탈로그(B10 섹션) 기준": "Unit: mm · The weight range reflects the difference between the SA (eccentric locking collar) and SB (set screw) types. Based on the official JIB catalog (Section B10).",
      "유닛 케이스 SALP·SBLP (경량 필로우) | [회사명] 베어링": "Unit Housing SALP·SBLP (Light Pillow) | [Company Name] Bearing",
      "형번 / 축경 검색": "Search by Model / Shaft Dia."
    },
